NEWPAGE

    "The past never relinquishes its grasp on the present until it has been 
 violently confronted by the future..."
                                       - Vvs. Alicia Alba Morey

 In this scenario, you and three other emperors are confronted with the 
 sluggish remains of the First Empire. At the periphery of an Imperial 
 Sector Capital, you must forge a kingdom out of the outlying worlds that no 
 longer owe allegiance to the Empire.
 
ENDTEXT

; Define Zones -----------------------------------------------------------------

DefineXY     Center 11,11
DefineZone   2   3,15   7,19        ; Empire 1 (Player)
DefineZone   3   15,3   19,7        ; Empire 2 (Player)
DefineZone   4    1,1    5,5        ; Empire 3 (Player)
DefineZone   5  17,15  21,19        ; Empire 4 (Player)
DefineZone   6    8,8  14,14        ; Empire 5 (Non-Player)

